---@field buildId? string The build id of the Version that you want to set as Current. Pass an empty value to set the Current Version to nil. A nil Current Version represents all the unversioned workers (those with `UNVERSIONED` (or unspecified) `WorkerVersioningMode`.)
---@field conflictToken? string Optional. This can be the value of conflict_token from a Describe, or another Worker Deployment API. Passing a non-nil conflict token will cause this request to fail if the Deployment's configuration has been modified between the API call that generated the token and this one.
