---@field approximateBacklogCount? string The approximate number of tasks backlogged in this task queue. May count expired tasks but eventually converges to the right value. Can be relied upon for scaling decisions. Special note for workflow task queue type: this metric does not count sticky queue tasks. However, because those tasks only remain valid for a few seconds, the inaccuracy becomes less significant as the backlog size grows.
